Package: descriptiveStats
Title: Basic Descriptive Statistics with Explicit Edge-Case Handling
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Samuel", "Díaz León", , "samuel92dl@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Mean, median, mode, first and third quartile, and
    interquartile range for numeric vectors. Every function validates its
    input with informative error messages and has documented behaviour for
    empty vectors, missing values and single values. The mode reports all
    tied values, and the quartile functions can use either the definition
    needed to reproduce the assessment example or any of the nine quantile
    types of base R.
